  "description": "A high-performance, zero-reflection-at-runtime object-to-object mapper for .NET.\n      v2.0 ships a bundled Roslyn Source Generator that emits compile-time MapTo extension\n      methods and EF Core-compatible ProjectTo expression properties for every registered\n      type pair — zero IL compilation overhead at startup. The runtime engine (Expression\n      Tree compilation, ForMember overrides, collection mapping, DFS cycle detection) is\n      retained for scenarios that require dynamic or convention-driven mapping.\n      Supports bi-directional mapping, property flattening, unflattening, nullable\n      coercion, numeric widening, enum conversion, and EF Core SQL projection.",
